Subject: [PATCH 06/14] NAT discovery server (cod7-stun) for titles' NAT type
 checks

DW_STUN_ADDR / DW_STUN_ALT_ADDR start a UDP responder with the live servers'
reply format, so Black Ops II gets past Play Online without Activision.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
